WEBVTT

00:01:28.390 --> 00:01:36.900 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:39.930 line:0%
[Episode 4]

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:46.990 line:0%
[Grace of Cloud and Water]

00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:00.450 line:0%
Morning, Grand Commander.

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:02.330 line:0%
It's already past 7 a.m.

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:03.790 line:0%
Seems like the Ministry of Justice

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:05.850 line:0%
doesn't enforce strict discipline.

00:02:07.130 --> 00:02:08.529 line:0%
Thanks to you,

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:11.280 line:0%
I slept extremely well last night.

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:16.040 line:0%
How sure are you that the murderer isn't

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:18.080 line:0%
from the second branch of the Liang family?

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:18.879 line:0%
90 percent.

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:22.240 line:0%
Go investigate quickly,

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:24.000 line:0%
while your head

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:25.530 line:0%
is still on your shoulders.

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:27.480 line:0%
If you keep making me

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:28.840 line:0%
stay up all night,

00:02:28.990 --> 00:02:30.590 line:0%
even if my head is still here,

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:32.040 line:0%
I'll have to lose my life anyway.

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:33.030 line:0%
Sir.

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:37.240 line:0%
Sir, Madam,

00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:38.640 line:0%
breakfast is ready.

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:40.120 line:0%
I have no appetite.

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:47.700 line:0%
Oh my,

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:49.520 line:0%
what a mess.

00:02:51.800 --> 00:02:53.629 line:0%
Yan Xing.

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:03.640 line:0%
Xing!

00:03:04.320 --> 00:03:05.120 line:0%
Chuichui.

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:06.680 line:0%
Seriously?

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:08.930 line:0%
Doesn't the Shen's Mansion provide meals?

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:10.000 line:0%
I'm afraid I might...

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:10.440 line:0%
She's still alive.

00:03:10.440 --> 00:03:11.040 line:0%
choke eating with him.

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:12.080 line:0%
She seems fine.

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:13.240 line:0%
Let's go.

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:14.490 line:0%
Choke?

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:16.010 line:0%
Come on.

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:18.379 line:0%
I heard that you and White Ghost

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:20.210 line:0%
are deeply in love,

00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:21.760 line:0%
like a

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:22.879 line:0%
harmonious couple.

00:03:22.879 --> 00:03:23.840 line:0%
I've heard about you

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:24.840 line:0%
riding together.

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:26.480 line:0%
Tell me about it.

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:28.400 line:0%
Indeed.

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:30.280 line:0%
Good news doesn't travel far.

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:32.080 line:0%
Bad news spreads like wildfire.

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:33.140 line:0%
Bad news?

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:34.240 line:0%
You're now

00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:35.400 line:0%
famous among the noble ladies

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:36.720 line:0%
of the Imperial City.

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:38.160 line:0%
Back then,

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:39.720 line:0%
there was a woman who pretended to faint

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:41.250 line:0%
and fell into Shen Du's arms

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:42.960 line:0%
and was arrested by the Imperial Security Bureau

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:43.960 line:0%
for offending

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:45.480 line:0%
the Grand Commander.

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:47.920 line:0%
That's so typical of him.

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:49.640 line:0%
Ever since then,

00:03:49.879 --> 00:03:51.040 line:0%
women in Xiang'an City

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:52.200 line:0%
avoid White Ghost

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:53.780 line:0%
like the plague.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:55.920 line:0%
But he showed affection to you in public,

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:58.340 line:0%
even intimate contact.

00:03:58.720 --> 00:04:00.280 line:0%
Better keep a distance.

00:04:09.880 --> 00:04:10.820 line:0%
What's going on?

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:16.040 line:0%
On the night of your wedding,

00:04:16.040 --> 00:04:17.440 line:0%
the Ming Hall caught fire.

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:18.960 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager was furious.

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:19.920 line:0%
Several people from the Imperial Security Bureau

00:04:19.920 --> 00:04:20.920 line:0%
were held accountable.

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:21.680 line:0%
Even your husband

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:22.940 line:0%
had his salary docked.

00:04:23.050 --> 00:04:24.200 line:0%
Really?

00:04:25.560 --> 00:04:26.480 line:0%
I heard that

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:28.520 line:0%
the poor scholar named Chen Baiyi

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:29.680 line:0%
set himself on fire

00:04:29.680 --> 00:04:31.160 line:0%
in the Ming Hall because he failed

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:32.800 line:0%
to achieve official rank.

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:34.360 line:0%
Now he's dead,

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:36.080 line:0%
and his family should have been implicated.

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:36.880 line:0%
However,

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:39.080 line:0%
all that's left of his family is

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:40.440 line:0%
this nearly 60-year-old,

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:42.100 line:0%
half-blind and deaf old lady.

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:43.760 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager was merciful

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:45.160 line:0%
and had pardoned her.

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:46.760 line:0%
But then this old lady

00:04:46.920 --> 00:04:48.160 line:0%
went to the entrance of the Ministry of Justice

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:49.130 line:0%
and sat for a long time,

00:04:49.130 --> 00:04:50.560 line:0%
demanding justice.

00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:52.800 line:0%
She sat there for a whole day and night.

00:04:52.800 --> 00:04:53.690 line:0%
Just imagine,

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:54.920 line:0%
who would dare to

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:56.160 line:0%
take this case?

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:00.520 line:0%
Are you out of your mind?

00:05:00.520 --> 00:05:01.960 line:0%
I'm going to lose my head either way.

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:03.490 line:0%
I only have one head anyway.

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:07.120 line:0%
Ma'am,

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:09.000 line:0%
please get up first.

00:05:09.170 --> 00:05:10.320 line:0%
If you really have a grievance,

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:10.880 line:0%
we'll definitely

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:12.080 line:0%
look into it.

00:05:21.470 --> 00:05:22.920 line:0%
Thank you, young lady.

00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:32.740 line:0%
[Yuan's Chang'an Collection]

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:34.959 line:0%
Who's so bold

00:05:34.959 --> 00:05:36.890 line:0%
to take that old lady's complaint?

00:05:37.360 --> 00:05:38.160 line:0%
Come on,

00:05:38.160 --> 00:05:39.280 line:0%
step forward.

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:40.160 line:0%
I'm in a good mood today.

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:42.020 line:0%
I promise not to beat you to death.

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:43.920 line:0%
Who took her complaint?

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:46.440 line:0%
You mean the old Mrs. Chen at the gate?

00:05:46.440 --> 00:05:48.000 line:0%
I've already sent her home.

00:05:53.690 --> 00:05:54.720 line:0%
Dismiss.

00:05:55.690 --> 00:05:57.080 line:0%
Let's go. Dismiss.

00:05:57.100 --> 00:05:57.750 line:0%
Let's go.

00:06:00.740 --> 00:06:02.660 line:0%
[Feng Gui]

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:06.100 line:0%
Why is it always...

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:16.040 line:0%
Actually, the old lady

00:06:16.130 --> 00:06:17.860 line:0%
should be properly comforted.

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:19.840 line:0%
Otherwise, it'd be improper

00:06:19.840 --> 00:06:20.440 line:0%
for her sitting in front of

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:22.370 line:0%
the Ministry of Justice every day.

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:31.560 line:0%
Regarding Chen Baiyi's self-immolation,

00:06:31.560 --> 00:06:32.160 line:0%
I've already

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:35.490 line:0%
-investigated the case...
-I'll leave the follow-up to...

00:06:36.640 --> 00:06:37.440 line:0%
Feng Gui!

00:06:39.690 --> 00:06:40.680 line:0%
Keep an eye on the old lady for me.

00:06:40.680 --> 00:06:42.080 line:0%
Don't let her come again.

00:06:42.640 --> 00:06:44.100 line:0%
Not me, please.

00:06:46.360 --> 00:06:47.160 line:0%
Director Wu,

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:48.060 line:0%
I think...

00:06:50.600 --> 00:06:52.060 line:0%
Everyone, gather around.

00:06:55.880 --> 00:06:58.840 line:0%
The case of Liang Chenzhong's murder has been

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:00.680 line:0%
taken over by the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:07:00.680 --> 00:07:01.920 line:0%
No one

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:10.720 line:0%
is allowed to interfere.

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:12.870 line:0%
The Imperial Security Bureau

00:07:13.360 --> 00:07:14.080 line:0%
is not a place

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:15.820 line:0%
to meddle with casually.

00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:17.530 line:0%
Anyone who disobeys

00:07:17.610 --> 00:07:19.560 line:0%
will be severely punished.

00:07:19.810 --> 00:07:20.800 line:0%
-Yes.
-Yes.

00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:23.400 line:0%
Get back to work now.

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:28.800 line:0%
Director Wu, I...

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:31.480 line:0%
Yan Xing.

00:07:32.120 --> 00:07:33.170 line:0%
Chuichui.

00:07:34.290 --> 00:07:35.440 line:0%
Haven't you two finished

00:07:35.440 --> 00:07:37.000 line:0%
organizing those files yet?

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:37.800 line:0%
Work hard.

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:39.400 line:0%
I really...

00:07:39.840 --> 00:07:40.640 line:0%
Xing,

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:42.200 line:0%
I suddenly remembered

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:43.160 line:0%
the Grand Commander Shen

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:44.820 line:0%
invited you for lunch, right?

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:48.880 line:0%
It's about time.

00:07:49.160 --> 00:07:49.959 line:0%
Well,

00:07:49.959 --> 00:07:51.520 line:0%
the case files aren't that urgent.

00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:52.920 line:0%
Lunch is more important.

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:54.560 line:0%
Lunch is more important.

00:07:57.630 --> 00:07:58.200 line:0%
Let's go.

00:08:01.300 --> 00:08:08.150 line:0%
[Tongming House]

00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:04.520 line:0%
Give up your little business.

00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:05.360 line:0%
Follow me.

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:06.720 line:0%
Alright.

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:07.920 line:0%
I'll rely on you then.

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:09.200 line:0%
My apologies, Madam.

00:08:09.820 --> 00:08:10.970 line:0%
[Ministry of Justice]

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:14.220 line:0%
[Ministry of Justice]

00:08:12.960 --> 00:08:14.400 line:0%
Tongming House only

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:15.690 line:0%
serves male guests,

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:16.780 line:0%
not female guests.

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:18.040 line:0%
We're not guests.

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:20.100 line:0%
We're here on official business.

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:22.200 line:0%
Then why not

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:24.140 line:0%
send a male official instead?

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:27.400 line:0%
I'm just a scribe,

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:28.520 line:0%
but this one here

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:29.720 line:0%
is a registered ninth-rank

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:31.920 line:0%
official from the Ministry of Justice.

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:33.469 line:0%
If you keep blocking us,

00:08:33.469 --> 00:08:34.330 line:0%
could it be that

00:08:34.469 --> 00:08:36.120 line:0%
you have objections to the government's

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:36.880 line:0%
official selection system?

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:40.630 line:0%
[Tongming House]

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:38.920 line:0%
Madam, please don't make things difficult for me.

00:08:38.920 --> 00:08:40.080 line:0%
If I let you two ladies

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:40.950 line:0%
in today,

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:41.950 line:0%
I'll

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:42.709 line:0%
probably

00:08:42.709 --> 00:08:43.830 line:0%
lose my job.

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:49.460 line:0%
Why don't you

00:08:49.720 --> 00:08:51.640 line:0%
take another look?

00:08:53.120 --> 00:08:54.480 line:0%
Are we male guests

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:56.320 line:0%
or female guests?

00:08:59.800 --> 00:09:00.600 line:0%
Male guests.

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:01.530 line:0%
Please, come in.

00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:08.150 line:0%
[Tongming House's Owner, Rong Zhui]

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:07.360 line:0%
My poor Zhanxin,

00:09:07.360 --> 00:09:09.240 line:0%
how could she be so miserable?

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:11.520 line:0%
I thought she'd

00:09:11.520 --> 00:09:13.160 line:0%
become a proper concubine

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:17.320 line:0%
with Liang Chenzhong.

00:09:18.050 --> 00:09:20.520 line:0%
Who could be so heartless

00:09:20.520 --> 00:09:21.760 line:0%
as to kill her?

00:09:27.430 --> 00:09:28.440 line:0%
My condolences.

00:09:28.840 --> 00:09:30.120 line:0%
Do you remember

00:09:30.560 --> 00:09:32.400 line:0%
if anything unusual

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:33.160 line:0%
happened before

00:09:33.160 --> 00:09:34.760 line:0%
Kuang Zhanxin disappeared,

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:36.400 line:0%
or did she have

00:09:36.640 --> 00:09:37.520 line:0%
any disputes

00:09:37.520 --> 00:09:39.040 line:0%
with anyone?

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:41.480 line:0%
Zhanxin was always gentle

00:09:41.710 --> 00:09:43.240 line:0%
and got along well

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:44.480 line:0%
with everyone.

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:47.480 line:0%
Before the officials informed you last night,

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:48.400 line:0%
you didn't know

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:50.200 line:0%
that Kuang Zhanxin was missing?

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:54.080 line:0%
She left on the 17th of last month

00:09:54.520 --> 00:09:56.800 line:0%
to go on an outing with Liang Chenzhong.

00:09:57.800 --> 00:09:58.960 line:0%
Liang Chenzhong often

00:09:58.960 --> 00:10:00.680 line:0%
took her out for fun.

00:10:01.560 --> 00:10:02.640 line:0%
I thought this time

00:10:02.640 --> 00:10:04.480 line:0%
they were just gone a bit longer.

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:08.600 line:0%
If we need anything else in the future,

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:09.840 line:0%
we'll come back to ask.

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:10.960 line:0%
My condolences.

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:21.520 line:0%
I heard that Chen Baiyi set himself on fire

00:10:21.520 --> 00:10:23.180 line:0%
and burned down the Ming Hall.

00:10:23.440 --> 00:10:25.570 line:0%
It's good that you drove him out early.

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:29.200 line:0%
The Cang State practices nepotism in official appointments.

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:30.600 line:0%
He's just a poor man

00:10:30.760 --> 00:10:33.160 line:0%
trying to climb up.

00:10:33.280 --> 00:10:35.280 line:0%
It's simply a pipe dream.

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:37.600 line:0%
It's his honor

00:10:37.810 --> 00:10:39.480 line:0%
to polish my writings.

00:10:39.760 --> 00:10:41.520 line:0%
But he still wasn't satisfied.

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:44.520 line:0%
These poor scholars

00:10:44.520 --> 00:10:46.560 line:0%
are so ungrateful!

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:48.240 line:0%
A tutor

00:10:48.280 --> 00:10:49.000 line:0%
trying to win

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:51.120 line:0%
first place in the Hongwen Academy's competition?

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:51.920 line:0%
Bah!

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:52.440 line:0%
Let's drink.

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:53.080 line:0%
Come on.

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:53.800 line:0%
Xing.

00:10:54.280 --> 00:10:55.080 line:0%
Xing.

00:10:57.280 --> 00:10:58.080 line:0%
Let's go.

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:09.120 line:0%
Xing?

00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:09.920 line:0%
Commander Xu?

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:11.680 line:0%
Secretary Lu.

00:11:13.760 --> 00:11:14.560 line:0%
Commander Xu,

00:11:14.680 --> 00:11:16.740 line:0%
you came to Tongming House for a case?

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:18.920 line:0%
The case that

00:11:18.920 --> 00:11:20.250 line:0%
your husband took over.

00:11:22.520 --> 00:11:23.520 line:0%
I guess I shouldn't

00:11:23.520 --> 00:11:24.800 line:0%
call you Xing anymore.

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:27.640 line:0%
I should address you as Mrs. Shen.

00:11:28.360 --> 00:11:29.160 line:0%
Commander Xu,

00:11:29.240 --> 00:11:30.680 line:0%
you can call me

00:11:30.680 --> 00:11:31.680 line:0%
Xing as usual.

00:11:31.680 --> 00:11:32.320 line:0%
Alright.

00:11:32.480 --> 00:11:33.240 line:0%
Then don't

00:11:33.240 --> 00:11:34.560 line:0%
call me Commander Xu either.

00:11:34.560 --> 00:11:35.680 line:0%
Call me Xu instead.

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:36.720 line:0%
Okay.

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:37.600 line:0%
Xu.

00:11:38.080 --> 00:11:38.920 line:0%
After the news about

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:40.180 line:0%
Kuang Zhanxin spread,

00:11:40.280 --> 00:11:41.320 line:0%
the owners around

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:42.280 line:0%
Pingkang House

00:11:42.440 --> 00:11:43.800 line:0%
all went crazy.

00:11:43.920 --> 00:11:44.760 line:0%
They thought

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:45.640 line:0%
any girl who left

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:46.770 line:0%
and didn't come back

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:47.810 line:0%
was missing.

00:11:48.120 --> 00:11:49.800 line:0%
A dozen cases have been reported already.

00:11:49.800 --> 00:11:51.120 line:0%
Are there more people missing?

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:51.920 line:0%
No.

00:11:52.360 --> 00:11:54.200 line:0%
17 girls were reported missing,

00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:56.010 line:0%
but 15 have already been found.

00:11:56.160 --> 00:11:57.200 line:0%
There are still two left.

00:11:57.200 --> 00:11:58.530 line:0%
They should be fine too.

00:11:59.080 --> 00:12:00.480 line:0%
But there's one thing

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:01.840 line:0%
I haven't decided whether

00:12:01.840 --> 00:12:02.840 line:0%
to report or not.

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:04.530 line:0%
And then I ran into you here.

00:12:05.880 --> 00:12:08.750 line:0%
[Missing Persons Case Files]

00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:07.480 line:0%
These files record

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:10.340 line:0%
the cases of missing performers over the years.

00:12:11.720 --> 00:12:14.130 line:0%
[Missing Persons Case Files]

00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:15.710 line:0%
[Qiuying, female, age 20, a singer from Yongle House]

00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:15.710 line:0%
[In the late summer of the first year of Yuanhe, on August 17, a commoner named Cao Meimao testified]

00:12:17.910 --> 00:12:18.850 line:0%
Strange.

00:12:19.720 --> 00:12:21.070 line:0%
Although not all of

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:22.000 line:0%
these performers were

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:23.680 line:0%
the top ones in their houses,

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:25.800 line:0%
they all understood music theory

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:27.040 line:0%
and excelled in instrumental music,

00:12:27.040 --> 00:12:28.040 line:0%
especially the pipa.

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:28.840 line:0%
That's right.

00:12:29.320 --> 00:12:30.580 line:0%
It's too much of a coincidence,

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:32.440 line:0%
which is why it seems suspicious.

00:12:37.920 --> 00:12:40.250 line:0%
These are portraits of the missing women.

00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:49.760 line:0%
These women

00:12:50.440 --> 00:12:52.500 line:0%
all have the same hairstyle.

00:13:00.520 --> 00:13:01.520 line:0%
Anything else?

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:03.600 line:0%
Look,

00:13:04.480 --> 00:13:05.880 line:0%
although their faces

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:08.830 line:0%
[Xiaohe, from Guanghan in Yizhou, 1.7 meters tall, good at playing pipa]

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:07.240 line:0%
are different,

00:13:07.480 --> 00:13:09.410 line:0%
they all have something in common.

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:11.000 line:0%
Especially their expressions

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:12.000 line:0%
are very similar.

00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:12.760 line:0%
Yes,

00:13:13.280 --> 00:13:14.500 line:0%
at first glance,

00:13:15.320 --> 00:13:17.680 line:0%
there's an indescribable similarity.

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:20.320 line:0%
I was planning

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:22.400 line:0%
to give these files to the Ministry of Justice,

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:23.200 line:0%
but I thought

00:13:23.200 --> 00:13:25.140 line:0%
it's improper to bypass the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:13:25.140 --> 00:13:26.160 line:0%
Now it seems

00:13:26.560 --> 00:13:28.220 line:0%
it's best for you to take them.

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:29.280 line:0%
At least White Ghost

00:13:29.280 --> 00:13:30.840 line:0%
won't kill his wife over this.

00:13:30.840 --> 00:13:31.560 line:0%
Right?

00:13:56.920 --> 00:13:58.600 line:0%
I'll take my leave then.

00:14:09.120 --> 00:14:10.320 line:0%
You were so determined before you left

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:11.320 line:0%
this morning.

00:14:12.040 --> 00:14:13.880 line:0%
I thought you went investigating,

00:14:13.880 --> 00:14:15.480 line:0%
but you're just chatting here.

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:16.560 line:0%
I'm discussing

00:14:16.560 --> 00:14:18.720 line:0%
the case with Commander Xu, who leads all the constables

00:14:18.720 --> 00:14:19.760 line:0%
in the city.

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:21.660 line:0%
Leads all the constables?

00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:23.320 line:0%
That impressive?

00:14:24.690 --> 00:14:25.800 line:0%
Commander Xu was

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:28.200 line:0%
once a famous outlaw with a bounty of

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:30.160 line:0%
100,000 taels on his head.

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:32.000 line:0%
So Commander Xu

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:33.440 line:0%
is the legendary one

00:14:33.480 --> 00:14:34.280 line:0%
who snuck into the palace

00:14:34.280 --> 00:14:37.040 line:0%
and stole the Grand Empress Dowager's jade pillow.

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:38.170 line:0%
Sounds impressive,

00:14:38.200 --> 00:14:39.440 line:0%
but he still got caught.

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:40.360 line:0%
Although he was caught,

00:14:40.360 --> 00:14:42.040 line:0%
the Grand Empress Dowager valued his talent.

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:43.520 line:0%
Not only did she not punish him,

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:45.160 line:0%
but she also freed him from slavery.

00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:46.560 line:0%
Still, getting caught

00:14:46.560 --> 00:14:47.760 line:0%
means he was

00:14:47.760 --> 00:14:48.640 line:0%
outmatched.

00:14:49.160 --> 00:14:49.440 line:0%
I...

00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:51.240 line:0%
What kind of case could you

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:53.720 line:0%
discuss with someone like him?

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:55.480 line:0%
Of course I can.

00:14:55.920 --> 00:14:57.360 line:0%
I'm about to win the bet

00:14:57.360 --> 00:14:58.690 line:0%
about the Liang family.

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:01.720 line:0%
The current evidence

00:15:01.720 --> 00:15:03.360 line:0%
all points to

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:04.600 line:0%
a series of murders that have been

00:15:04.600 --> 00:15:05.560 line:0%
happening for years.

00:15:05.560 --> 00:15:07.000 line:0%
Once I find the real culprit,

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:08.000 line:0%
the second branch of the Liang family can

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:10.060 line:0%
be completely cleared of suspicion.

00:15:14.240 --> 00:15:15.080 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:16.240 line:0%
people watching the Liang family reported

00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:16.880 line:0%
that the second branch of the Liang family

00:15:16.880 --> 00:15:18.280 line:0%
had been splashed with chicken blood by the main branch.

00:15:18.280 --> 00:15:19.600 line:0%
Second Madam Liang became even more deranged.

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:20.560 line:0%
And Third Young Master Liang

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:22.160 line:0%
turned himself in to the Ministry of Justice.

00:15:22.160 --> 00:15:22.880 line:0%
Also,

00:15:22.880 --> 00:15:24.610 line:0%
Princess Ying wants to see you.

00:15:28.390 --> 00:15:29.970 line:0%
[Guangyue Restaurant]

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:34.020 line:0%
Princess Ying

00:15:34.020 --> 00:15:36.350 line:0%
requests to see only the Grand Commander.

00:15:57.440 --> 00:15:58.480 line:0%
Your Highness.

00:16:00.800 --> 00:16:02.730 line:0%
Liang Chenyu has been imprisoned.

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:06.000 line:0%
This is not what the Grand Empress Dowager wished for.

00:16:10.340 --> 00:16:12.440 line:0%
If I remember correctly,

00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:14.320 line:0%
the Grand Empress Dowager

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:15.720 line:0%
did not ask you to thoroughly

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:17.050 line:0%
investigate this case,

00:16:18.960 --> 00:16:21.890 line:0%
but to protect the second branch of the Liang family.

00:16:25.860 --> 00:16:27.920 line:0%
The evidence is not sufficient at the moment.

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:29.920 line:0%
No conclusion has been reached yet.

00:16:43.360 --> 00:16:45.880 line:0%
You've always been meticulous in your work.

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:47.570 line:0%
But this time,

00:16:47.720 --> 00:16:49.980 line:0%
you're not following the rules as usual.

00:16:51.560 --> 00:16:53.890 line:0%
Don't follow in your father's footsteps,

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:57.400 line:0%
quietly making big moves.

00:17:05.909 --> 00:17:07.710 line:0%
I wouldn't dare, Your Highness.

00:17:20.629 --> 00:17:21.560 line:0%
Princess Ying must be

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:22.840 line:0%
giving the Grand Commander a hard time.

00:17:22.840 --> 00:17:23.800 line:0%
Regarding the Liang family case,

00:17:23.800 --> 00:17:24.909 line:0%
the Grand Empress Dowager has already instructed

00:17:24.909 --> 00:17:26.240 line:0%
to protect the second branch of the Liang family.

00:17:26.240 --> 00:17:26.720 line:0%
But you

00:17:26.720 --> 00:17:27.840 line:0%
insist on investigating it thoroughly.

00:17:27.840 --> 00:17:28.680 line:0%
Now look what's happened.

00:17:28.680 --> 00:17:30.200 line:0%
Third Young Master Liang has been imprisoned.

00:17:30.200 --> 00:17:31.080 line:0%
How can the Grand Commander

00:17:31.080 --> 00:17:33.080 line:0%
explain this to the higher-ups now?

00:17:35.080 --> 00:17:37.640 line:0%
I will take full responsibility for this case.

00:17:37.640 --> 00:17:38.440 line:0%
I will definitely provide

00:17:38.440 --> 00:17:40.100 line:0%
a satisfactory explanation.

00:17:48.280 --> 00:17:50.410 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager trusts you,

00:17:50.680 --> 00:17:52.760 line:0%
and so do I.

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:55.100 line:0%
I just hope that you

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:57.160 line:0%
will not betray this trust.

00:18:01.280 --> 00:18:03.680 line:0%
I heard that Mrs. Shen

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:05.960 line:0%
is quite an interesting person.

00:18:10.160 --> 00:18:12.280 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager has bestowed this marriage.

00:18:12.280 --> 00:18:13.640 line:0%
It's my great honor.

00:18:15.960 --> 00:18:16.960 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:18:18.080 --> 00:18:18.800 line:0%
five pairs of corpses

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:19.840 line:0%
were found at Ximing Temple,

00:18:19.840 --> 00:18:22.570 line:0%
with the same cause of death as the previous two.

00:18:23.760 --> 00:18:24.760 line:0%
It seems

00:18:26.440 --> 00:18:27.200 line:0%
this case is indeed

00:18:27.200 --> 00:18:30.130 line:0%
unrelated to the second branch of the Liang family.

00:18:38.200 --> 00:18:40.320 line:0%
Including the previous two bodies,

00:18:40.680 --> 00:18:41.960 line:0%
there are six pairs of men and women,

00:18:41.960 --> 00:18:43.200 line:0%
12 bodies in total.

00:18:43.240 --> 00:18:45.160 line:0%
The killer's method is the same for all victims:

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:46.480 line:0%
the men's hearts were removed,

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:48.680 line:0%
and the women's faces were disfigured.

00:18:54.960 --> 00:18:56.960 line:0%
This isn't soil from Ximing Temple.

00:18:58.200 --> 00:18:59.200 line:0%
These bodies

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:00.760 line:0%
have been moved recently

00:19:00.960 --> 00:19:02.440 line:0%
and reburied.

00:19:02.840 --> 00:19:03.880 line:0%
The face is dark purple,

00:19:03.880 --> 00:19:05.410 line:0%
with flesh turned outward.

00:19:05.640 --> 00:19:07.040 line:0%
But I can still tell

00:19:07.240 --> 00:19:08.560 line:0%
this is a young woman.

00:19:08.680 --> 00:19:09.640 line:0%
Can you estimate

00:19:09.640 --> 00:19:10.840 line:0%
the time of death?

00:19:11.720 --> 00:19:12.680 line:0%
These two

00:19:12.720 --> 00:19:15.000 line:0%
were likely killed last month.

00:19:16.040 --> 00:19:17.380 line:0%
There's a lot of

00:19:17.520 --> 00:19:19.800 line:0%
charcoal and ashes around the bodies,

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:22.120 line:0%
probably to cover up the smell.

00:19:25.960 --> 00:19:28.000 line:0%
What's that strange scent?

00:19:28.280 --> 00:19:29.340 line:0%
Anything unusual?

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:34.030 line:0%
If my master were here,

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:35.120 line:0%
he'd be able to identify

00:19:35.120 --> 00:19:36.480 line:0%
what's in this.

00:19:37.560 --> 00:19:38.430 line:0%
In my opinion,

00:19:38.460 --> 00:19:39.360 line:0%
you've already inherited

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:40.620 line:0%
your master's skills.

00:19:41.040 --> 00:19:41.840 line:0%
You're no less than

00:19:41.840 --> 00:19:43.320 line:0%
the famous folk detective Pan Chi.

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:44.600 line:0%
I'm far from that.

00:19:44.900 --> 00:19:46.120 line:0%
After my master retired,

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:47.200 line:0%
he's been traveling around.

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:48.000 line:0%
I'm afraid he has forgotten

00:19:48.000 --> 00:19:49.120 line:0%
about me.

00:19:51.320 --> 00:19:52.120 line:0%
This is

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:54.040 line:0%
the earliest pair of bodies found,

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:55.300 line:0%
severely decomposed.

00:19:56.480 --> 00:19:57.800 line:0%
The time of death

00:19:57.920 --> 00:20:00.050 line:0%
is difficult to determine precisely.

00:20:00.200 --> 00:20:01.570 line:0%
It's likely

00:20:01.920 --> 00:20:03.650 line:0%
between four to six years ago.

00:20:04.160 --> 00:20:05.960 line:0%
If it's the same killer,

00:20:06.560 --> 00:20:08.160 line:0%
that's utterly insane.

00:20:08.480 --> 00:20:09.720 line:0%
A heart ripper.

00:20:09.920 --> 00:20:10.600 line:0%
The killer must be

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:11.840 line:0%
a strong man,

00:20:12.200 --> 00:20:13.400 line:0%
perhaps a butcher.

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:16.130 line:0%
In my opinion,

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:17.840 line:0%
the killer is most likely

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:19.320 line:0%
a woman.

00:20:20.040 --> 00:20:20.840 line:0%
Why?

00:20:21.600 --> 00:20:24.080 line:0%
The cuts on each woman's face are almost

00:20:24.080 --> 00:20:24.880 line:0%
identical

00:20:24.880 --> 00:20:25.400 line:0%
in position,

00:20:25.400 --> 00:20:26.200 line:0%
length,

00:20:26.440 --> 00:20:27.800 line:0%
and depth.

00:20:28.420 --> 00:20:30.080 line:0%
It doesn't seem like

00:20:30.280 --> 00:20:31.840 line:0%
the work of a man.

00:20:32.920 --> 00:20:34.520 line:0%
If the killer's a woman,

00:20:35.320 --> 00:20:36.200 line:0%
she would have had to

00:20:36.200 --> 00:20:37.680 line:0%
kill 12 people over these years.

00:20:37.680 --> 00:20:39.000 line:0%
These male victims

00:20:39.600 --> 00:20:41.080 line:0%
weren't weak or infirm either.

00:20:41.080 --> 00:20:43.480 line:0%
They were all in their prime when they died.

00:20:43.520 --> 00:20:45.800 line:0%
How could they possibly be overpowered by a woman?

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:46.600 line:0%
Xu,

00:20:46.960 --> 00:20:48.320 line:0%
if we dismiss something

00:20:48.320 --> 00:20:49.560 line:0%
just because we haven't seen it before,

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:51.320 line:0%
then many strange cases in this world

00:20:51.320 --> 00:20:53.120 line:0%
would remain unsolved forever.

00:20:53.720 --> 00:20:54.400 line:0%
Let's go.

00:20:56.520 --> 00:20:57.040 line:0%
What...

00:21:02.850 --> 00:21:04.480 line:0%
What exactly are you doing?

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:16.660 line:0%
Princess Ying has already ordered

00:21:16.660 --> 00:21:17.600 line:0%
that the Ximing Temple case

00:21:17.600 --> 00:21:18.920 line:0%
and the Liang's Mansion case

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:19.960 line:0%
be combined and handled

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:21.820 line:0%
by the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:21:22.390 --> 00:21:23.720 line:0%
The Ministry of Justice

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:25.320 line:0%
can no longer interfere.

00:21:26.000 --> 00:21:27.160 line:0%
Alright then.

00:21:28.200 --> 00:21:29.930 line:0%
I'll take you somewhere first.

00:21:32.920 --> 00:21:33.980 line:0%
Where are we going?

00:21:34.320 --> 00:21:34.760 line:0%
You...

00:21:43.480 --> 00:21:44.400 line:0%
In her sleeves,

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:46.310 line:0%
it's the scent of white brain incense.

00:21:46.310 --> 00:21:48.510 line:0%
A silk brocade robe with ruyi patterns.

00:21:49.600 --> 00:21:51.080 line:0%
A jade floral hairpin.

00:21:51.960 --> 00:21:54.020 line:0%
A white silk fan with peony patterns.

00:21:59.120 --> 00:22:00.520 line:0%
If you have time to daydream here,

00:22:00.520 --> 00:22:02.180 line:0%
you'd better think carefully

00:22:02.680 --> 00:22:04.440 line:0%
about how to keep your head.

00:22:07.040 --> 00:22:08.570 line:0%
Where exactly are we going?

00:22:10.960 --> 00:22:12.360 line:0%
The Ministry of Justice.

00:22:19.120 --> 00:22:20.360 line:0%
Put me down now.

00:22:20.520 --> 00:22:21.920 line:0%
We're almost at the Ministry of Justice.

00:22:21.920 --> 00:22:23.320 line:0%
I can walk there myself.

00:22:23.680 --> 00:22:25.200 line:0%
The real culprit hasn't been found yet.

00:22:25.200 --> 00:22:26.920 line:0%
Third Young Master Liang is still in prison.

00:22:26.920 --> 00:22:28.450 line:0%
If anything happens to him,

00:22:28.840 --> 00:22:30.770 line:0%
you'll be joining him in the grave.

00:22:36.650 --> 00:22:37.910 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen,

00:22:38.240 --> 00:22:39.520 line:0%
I, Yan Xing, have never

00:22:39.520 --> 00:22:40.560 line:0%
lost a bet.

00:22:53.880 --> 00:22:55.320 line:0%
What brings the Grand Commander

00:22:55.320 --> 00:22:56.480 line:0%
here today?

00:22:56.600 --> 00:22:57.440 line:0%
Can't I come?

00:22:58.320 --> 00:22:59.840 line:0%
Grand Commander, what are you saying?

00:22:59.840 --> 00:23:00.880 line:0%
Welcome, welcome.

00:23:00.880 --> 00:23:02.240 line:0%
I'm here to request someone

00:23:02.240 --> 00:23:04.500 line:0%
to help at the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:23:04.600 --> 00:23:05.920 line:0%
You want to transfer someone?

00:23:05.920 --> 00:23:06.920 line:0%
That's easy.

00:23:07.160 --> 00:23:08.080 line:0%
Who do you want?

00:23:08.080 --> 00:23:09.640 line:0%
I'll arrange it right away.

00:23:13.160 --> 00:23:14.040 line:0%
Her.

00:23:20.650 --> 00:23:21.880 line:0%
The 10 corpses case at Ximing Temple

00:23:21.880 --> 00:23:24.120 line:0%
has been fully handed over to the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:23:24.120 --> 00:23:25.840 line:0%
The Ministry of Justice should not interfere anymore.

00:23:25.840 --> 00:23:26.640 line:0%
Understood.

00:23:27.640 --> 00:23:28.520 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:23:28.520 --> 00:23:30.000 line:0%
there are still many case files

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:30.960 line:0%
that I haven't finished recording.

00:23:30.960 --> 00:23:34.690 line:0%
I'm afraid I can't be transferred to the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:23:37.240 --> 00:23:39.440 line:0%
What are you saying, Miss Yan?

00:23:41.240 --> 00:23:42.840 line:0%
If the files aren't finished,

00:23:42.840 --> 00:23:44.360 line:0%
hand them over to Secretary Lu.

00:23:44.360 --> 00:23:46.360 line:0%
You go with the Grand Commander now.

00:23:48.120 --> 00:23:49.520 line:0%
If Miss Yan doesn't come,

00:23:52.000 --> 00:23:53.520 line:0%
the case will just be closed.

00:23:53.520 --> 00:23:54.320 line:0%
Director Wu,

00:23:55.520 --> 00:23:57.520 line:0%
take those corpses outside the city

00:23:57.720 --> 00:23:59.320 line:0%
and bury them anywhere.

00:24:02.920 --> 00:24:03.720 line:0%
No way.

00:24:04.340 --> 00:24:05.280 line:0%
I'll go right away.

00:24:05.280 --> 00:24:06.000 line:0%
Xing,

00:24:07.720 --> 00:24:09.720 line:0%
these were found at Chen Baiyi's house.

00:24:09.720 --> 00:24:10.600 line:0%
I've read all the articles

00:24:10.600 --> 00:24:11.520 line:0%
he wrote.

00:24:11.680 --> 00:24:13.680 line:0%
Each piece is brilliantly written.

00:24:14.080 --> 00:24:15.080 line:0%
Thank you

00:24:15.320 --> 00:24:16.520 line:0%
for your hard work.

00:24:16.520 --> 00:24:17.570 line:0%
It's okay.

00:24:17.680 --> 00:24:19.160 line:0%
Watching opera at Furong Garden?

00:24:19.160 --> 00:24:19.960 line:0%
Approved.

00:24:22.320 --> 00:24:23.200 line:0%
Be careful.

00:24:26.640 --> 00:24:27.640 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:24:27.800 --> 00:24:30.800 line:0%
the coroner has completed the preliminary analysis.

00:24:33.880 --> 00:24:34.680 line:0%
Jing Lin.

00:24:35.640 --> 00:24:36.440 line:0%
If it's discovered later

00:24:36.440 --> 00:24:38.280 line:0%
people from the Ministry of Justice investigate the case privately,

00:24:38.280 --> 00:24:40.520 line:0%
they will all be dealt with as factionalism.

00:24:40.520 --> 00:24:41.110 line:0%
Yes.

00:24:42.080 --> 00:24:43.200 line:0%
Then I must thank you

00:24:43.200 --> 00:24:45.080 line:0%
for your patronage, Grand Commander,

00:24:45.080 --> 00:24:45.600 line:0%
allowing me the right

00:24:45.600 --> 00:24:47.060 line:0%
to investigate this case.

00:24:47.520 --> 00:24:49.640 line:0%
I will do my utmost to solve the case

00:24:49.640 --> 00:24:50.770 line:0%
as soon as possible.

00:24:50.880 --> 00:24:52.130 line:0%
I'm glad you understand.

00:24:52.130 --> 00:24:52.940 line:0%
[Report]

00:24:53.520 --> 00:24:55.280 line:0%
Since I've been transferred to the Imperial Security Bureau,

00:24:55.280 --> 00:24:56.000 line:0%
I'm now

00:24:56.000 --> 00:24:57.480 line:0%
a member of you

00:24:57.640 --> 00:24:58.440 line:0%
and must follow

00:24:58.440 --> 00:24:59.720 line:0%
your rules.

00:24:59.830 --> 00:25:01.480 line:0%
I'm just a mere scribe.

00:25:01.560 --> 00:25:02.840 line:0%
How could I ride a horse

00:25:02.840 --> 00:25:04.440 line:0%
with the Grand Commander?

00:25:07.480 --> 00:25:08.920 line:0%
My horsemanship is poor.

00:25:11.240 --> 00:25:13.570 line:0%
Guard Jing, you care for the subordinates

00:25:13.680 --> 00:25:14.520 line:0%
and surely

00:25:14.520 --> 00:25:15.560 line:0%
wouldn't leave me behind.

00:25:15.560 --> 00:25:16.440 line:0%
Isn't that right?

00:25:16.440 --> 00:25:17.240 line:0%
Me?

00:25:18.040 --> 00:25:19.280 line:0%
Then I'll have to

00:25:19.280 --> 00:25:20.600 line:0%
bother you

00:25:20.600 --> 00:25:21.800 line:0%
to share a ride with me.

00:25:21.800 --> 00:25:22.840 line:0%
Madam, if you wants to ride a horse,

00:25:22.840 --> 00:25:24.640 line:0%
you should ride with the Grand Commander.

00:25:24.640 --> 00:25:25.940 line:0%
I...

00:25:38.260 --> 00:25:39.790 line:0%
I'll lead the horse for you.

00:25:40.020 --> 00:25:41.600 line:0%
That would be inappropriate.

00:25:41.600 --> 00:25:43.080 line:0%
Let's ride together.

00:25:43.080 --> 00:25:44.280 line:0%
There's no gender distinction in solving cases.

00:25:44.280 --> 00:25:44.960 line:0%
Guard Jing,

00:25:44.960 --> 00:25:45.680 line:0%
just treat me as

00:25:45.680 --> 00:25:47.080 line:0%
an ordinary colleague.

00:25:47.310 --> 00:25:48.910 line:0%
Madam, please sit properly.

00:25:49.360 --> 00:25:50.640 line:0%
Are you done chatting?

00:25:50.740 --> 00:25:52.320 line:0%
If you keep being so casual,

00:25:52.640 --> 00:25:54.700 line:0%
I'll dock your salary for half a year.

00:25:55.960 --> 00:25:56.800 line:0%
I... I...

00:25:58.160 --> 00:25:59.160 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:26:11.680 --> 00:26:12.440 line:0%
These

00:26:12.440 --> 00:26:13.320 line:0%
were taken from the first

00:26:13.320 --> 00:26:14.760 line:0%
pair of victims' bodies.

00:26:19.150 --> 00:26:20.530 line:0%
It was marked

00:26:20.960 --> 00:26:22.960 line:0%
in the first year of the Shengli era.

00:26:29.520 --> 00:26:30.400 line:0%
This belonged to

00:26:30.400 --> 00:26:31.800 line:0%
the first male victim.

00:26:32.800 --> 00:26:34.360 line:0%
The killer's first crime

00:26:34.960 --> 00:26:36.560 line:0%
must have been six years ago.

00:26:37.200 --> 00:26:38.000 line:0%
Why?

00:26:42.850 --> 00:26:45.000 line:0%
The killer's method

00:26:45.000 --> 00:26:46.400 line:0%
is identical every time.

00:26:46.960 --> 00:26:47.960 line:0%
The time of the crimes

00:26:47.960 --> 00:26:49.800 line:0%
must also follow a pattern.

00:26:49.950 --> 00:26:51.760 line:0%
As the saying goes, "A tiny mistake can

00:26:51.760 --> 00:26:53.090 line:0%
lead to a huge error."

00:26:53.200 --> 00:26:54.660 line:0%
If our deduction is wrong,

00:26:54.720 --> 00:26:55.920 line:0%
finding the real culprit

00:26:55.920 --> 00:26:57.340 line:0%
won't be so easy.

00:27:06.400 --> 00:27:07.800 line:0%
The double fish pattern.

00:27:14.500 --> 00:27:15.500 line:0%
Jinxiu Workshop?

00:27:16.030 --> 00:27:17.560 line:0%
This double fish pattern

00:27:17.560 --> 00:27:18.560 line:0%
was a special design

00:27:18.560 --> 00:27:19.520 line:0%
created by Jinxiu Workshop

00:27:19.520 --> 00:27:21.250 line:0%
that swept across the country.

00:27:21.400 --> 00:27:22.760 line:0%
Jinxiu Workshop was the largest silk workshop

00:27:22.760 --> 00:27:24.080 line:0%
in the Imperial City at that time.

00:27:24.080 --> 00:27:26.440 line:0%
They presented silk to the palace on the first day of every month.

00:27:26.440 --> 00:27:28.440 line:0%
However, in June of the third year of Shengli,

00:27:28.440 --> 00:27:29.320 line:0%
Jinxiu Workshop was accused of treason

00:27:29.320 --> 00:27:30.920 line:0%
for making summer clothes for Princess Runing that exceeded regulations.

00:27:30.920 --> 00:27:32.900 line:0%
They were charged with the crime of insubordination.

00:27:32.900 --> 00:27:34.720 line:0%
So after that,

00:27:34.720 --> 00:27:35.880 line:0%
no one in the Imperial City

00:27:35.880 --> 00:27:38.640 line:0%
dared to wear fabrics from Jinxiu Workshop in public.

00:27:38.640 --> 00:27:39.600 line:0%
This man

00:27:39.600 --> 00:27:40.360 line:0%
must have died

00:27:40.360 --> 00:27:42.640 line:0%
before the Jinxiu Workshop treason case.

00:27:42.640 --> 00:27:44.800 line:0%
The gold medal was made in the first year of Shengli.

00:27:44.800 --> 00:27:46.160 line:0%
It's possible that the man died

00:27:46.160 --> 00:27:47.240 line:0%
in the same year.

00:27:47.240 --> 00:27:48.000 line:0%
Impossible.

00:27:49.800 --> 00:27:50.960 line:0%
The double fish pattern

00:27:50.960 --> 00:27:52.040 line:0%
was from the third year of Shengli.

00:27:52.040 --> 00:27:54.040 line:0%
It was a spring clothing style made by Jinxiu Workshop,

00:27:54.040 --> 00:27:56.440 line:0%
only sold from February to April that year.

00:27:56.470 --> 00:27:58.000 line:0%
You remember it so clearly.

00:27:59.560 --> 00:28:00.280 line:0%
There are

00:28:00.280 --> 00:28:02.200 line:0%
files of old cases from Jinxiu Workshop in the archives.

00:28:02.200 --> 00:28:03.520 line:0%
There's an illustrated catalog

00:28:03.520 --> 00:28:04.240 line:0%
that records

00:28:04.240 --> 00:28:06.560 line:0%
ten years of pattern styles from Jinxiu Workshop.

00:28:06.560 --> 00:28:07.360 line:0%
Jing Lin,

00:28:08.240 --> 00:28:09.360 line:0%
go and verify it.

00:28:09.520 --> 00:28:10.920 line:0%
There must be no mistake.

00:28:11.360 --> 00:28:12.160 line:0%
Yes.

00:28:22.420 --> 00:28:24.290 line:0%
[Chang'an City]

00:28:26.400 --> 00:28:27.200 line:0%
Madam,

00:28:27.200 --> 00:28:27.800 line:0%
the archives room

00:28:27.800 --> 00:28:29.400 line:0%
is full of precious items and rare books.

00:28:29.400 --> 00:28:31.000 line:0%
Please don't wander around,

00:28:33.400 --> 00:28:34.880 line:0%
and don't touch anything.

00:28:36.300 --> 00:28:37.360 line:0%
I know.

00:28:37.360 --> 00:28:39.040 line:0%
We'll find it faster if we split up.

00:28:39.040 --> 00:28:39.960 line:0%
You go that way.

00:28:39.960 --> 00:28:41.820 line:0%
Remember, don't touch anything.

00:28:52.990 --> 00:28:57.430 line:0%
[Compilation of Selected Test Essays from Hongwen Academy]

00:28:56.760 --> 00:29:00.090 line:0%
Compilation of Selected Test Essays from Hongwen Academy.

00:29:00.610 --> 00:29:01.930 line:0%
[Essay Four: In the empty mountains, dragons weep with sorrow, and heaven shines brightly]

00:29:05.880 --> 00:29:07.240 line:0%
Be quick with your hands.

00:29:07.240 --> 00:29:08.200 line:0%
Hurry up!

00:29:08.720 --> 00:29:10.110 line:0%
Don't drop anything.

00:29:10.240 --> 00:29:11.440 line:0%
What's going on here?

00:29:12.470 --> 00:29:13.520 line:0%
Wait a moment.

00:29:14.680 --> 00:29:15.140 line:0%
Hold on.

00:29:15.560 --> 00:29:16.360 line:0%
Why are you here?

00:29:16.360 --> 00:29:17.280 line:0%
Weren't you transferred to

00:29:17.280 --> 00:29:18.360 line:0%
the Imperial Security Bureau?

00:29:18.360 --> 00:29:19.640 line:0%
I need to see Director Wu.

00:29:19.640 --> 00:29:21.760 line:0%
There's been progress in the Chen Baiyi self-immolation case.

00:29:21.760 --> 00:29:23.080 line:0%
The director has said

00:29:23.120 --> 00:29:24.360 line:0%
no one is allowed to

00:29:24.360 --> 00:29:26.160 line:0%
mention the Ming Hall case again.

00:29:26.160 --> 00:29:27.360 line:0%
If anyone asks again,

00:29:27.360 --> 00:29:28.240 line:0%
they should submit their resignation.

00:29:28.240 --> 00:29:29.560 line:0%
There's really something fishy about it.

00:29:29.560 --> 00:29:30.760 line:0%
I want to see Director Wu.

00:29:30.760 --> 00:29:31.760 line:0%
Wait, wait.

00:29:31.840 --> 00:29:32.960 line:0%
Can't you see?

00:29:33.000 --> 00:29:34.320 line:0%
The entire Ministry of Justice today

00:29:34.320 --> 00:29:35.480 line:0%
has been thrown into chaos

00:29:35.480 --> 00:29:36.680 line:0%
by a nursery rhyme.

00:29:36.680 --> 00:29:37.720 line:0%
Who has time

00:29:37.800 --> 00:29:39.440 line:0%
to investigate the self-immolation case?

00:29:39.440 --> 00:29:39.990 line:0%
Right?

00:29:40.010 --> 00:29:41.120 line:0%
What nursery rhyme?

00:29:41.120 --> 00:29:42.080 line:0%
You don't know?

00:29:43.920 --> 00:29:45.400 line:0%
It's serious.

00:29:45.400 --> 00:29:46.520 line:0%
It's spread all over

00:29:46.520 --> 00:29:47.580 line:0%
the Imperial City.

00:29:48.240 --> 00:29:49.480 line:0%
I wonder this time

00:29:49.680 --> 00:29:51.440 line:0%
who's going to suffer.

00:29:54.640 --> 00:29:55.600 line:0%
Slow down.

00:29:55.600 --> 00:29:56.560 line:0%
Watch out for the steps.

00:29:56.560 --> 00:29:57.950 line:0%
People are heartless.

00:29:58.000 --> 00:29:59.280 line:0%
Buddha eats hearts.

00:29:59.360 --> 00:30:02.080 line:0%
Chaos reigns under the Son of Heaven's feet.

00:30:02.360 --> 00:30:04.980 line:0%
Buddha devours hearts to conceal sins.

00:30:05.120 --> 00:30:06.650 line:0%
The Black Rakshasa is here.

00:30:16.290 --> 00:30:17.240 line:0%
Kid,

00:30:19.680 --> 00:30:21.320 line:0%
do you realize what you just said

00:30:21.320 --> 00:30:22.840 line:0%
is extremely treasonous?

00:30:25.700 --> 00:30:26.680 line:0%
Tell me,

00:30:27.680 --> 00:30:29.160 line:0%
how should I punish you?

00:30:31.070 --> 00:30:32.360 line:0%
Try this new invention called

00:30:32.360 --> 00:30:33.420 line:0%
"Get into the Urn."

00:30:34.480 --> 00:30:35.360 line:0%
Later,

00:30:35.880 --> 00:30:37.680 line:0%
we'll put the urn over a fire,

00:30:39.250 --> 00:30:41.080 line:0%
and you'll have even more fun.

00:30:43.360 --> 00:30:44.160 line:0%
Guards!

00:30:47.600 --> 00:30:48.470 line:0%
-No! My lord!
-No!

00:30:48.470 --> 00:30:49.360 line:0%
-No! My lord!
-My lord!

00:30:49.360 --> 00:30:50.230 line:0%
No! My lord!

00:30:50.260 --> 00:30:50.960 line:0%
-My lord!
-No!

00:30:50.960 --> 00:30:52.520 line:0%
My lord, he's just a child.

00:30:52.520 --> 00:30:54.030 line:0%
I beg you to spare him, my lord.

00:30:54.030 --> 00:30:55.440 line:0%
Spreading such

00:30:55.440 --> 00:30:57.040 line:0%
treasonous words.

00:30:57.480 --> 00:30:58.480 line:0%
Doesn't that make

00:30:58.640 --> 00:30:59.320 line:0%
the Imperial City

00:30:59.320 --> 00:31:00.840 line:0%
a lawless place?

00:31:00.840 --> 00:31:02.560 line:0%
-No, my lord.
-My lord, he's innocent.

00:31:02.560 --> 00:31:04.560 line:0%
If you don't properly educate your child,

00:31:04.560 --> 00:31:06.070 line:0%
then I'll do it for you.

00:31:06.160 --> 00:31:07.520 line:0%
Please don't, my lord!

00:31:07.600 --> 00:31:10.000 line:0%
Make way for the Princess Ying's carriage!

00:31:24.200 --> 00:31:25.440 line:0%
Your Highness.

00:31:32.990 --> 00:31:34.600 line:0%
This person looks familiar.

00:31:34.680 --> 00:31:36.320 line:0%
What's all the commotion about?

00:31:36.320 --> 00:31:37.000 line:0%
Your Highness.

00:31:37.000 --> 00:31:38.320 line:0%
I beg you, please save my child!

00:31:38.320 --> 00:31:40.240 line:0%
I beg you, please save my child!

00:31:40.240 --> 00:31:40.800 line:0%
Your Highness,

00:31:40.800 --> 00:31:43.000 line:0%
I came to patrol the streets today,

00:31:43.520 --> 00:31:45.400 line:0%
and suddenly heard a child speaking

00:31:45.400 --> 00:31:46.480 line:0%
treasonous words.

00:31:47.160 --> 00:31:49.220 line:0%
That's why we apprehended the child.

00:31:49.520 --> 00:31:51.320 line:0%
I apologize for disturbing you.

00:31:51.640 --> 00:31:52.920 line:0%
I see.

00:31:52.960 --> 00:31:54.440 line:0%
Please have mercy, Your Highness.

00:31:54.440 --> 00:31:55.800 line:0%
The child spoke without thinking.

00:31:55.800 --> 00:31:56.970 line:0%
I'll take him home

00:31:56.990 --> 00:31:58.280 line:0%
and teach him properly.

00:31:58.280 --> 00:31:59.480 line:0%
Yes, Your Highness.

00:31:59.500 --> 00:32:00.560 line:0%
If a child is not taught properly,

00:32:00.560 --> 00:32:01.720 line:0%
it is the father's fault.

00:32:01.720 --> 00:32:03.580 line:0%
You cannot escape blame for this.

00:32:10.170 --> 00:32:11.280 line:0%
Lord Lai,

00:32:12.130 --> 00:32:14.740 line:0%
everyone makes mistakes.

00:32:14.920 --> 00:32:15.910 line:0%
Moreover,

00:32:16.080 --> 00:32:17.960 line:0%
this is just a young child.

00:32:18.400 --> 00:32:20.350 line:0%
You've always been wise.

00:32:20.720 --> 00:32:22.520 line:0%
Why tarnish your reputation

00:32:22.920 --> 00:32:24.760 line:0%
over a mere child?

00:32:25.040 --> 00:32:26.500 line:0%
Though that may be true...

00:32:26.720 --> 00:32:29.050 line:0%
Since I've encountered this child today,

00:32:29.330 --> 00:32:30.430 line:0%
it means

00:32:31.200 --> 00:32:34.280 line:0%
this child and I are destined to meet.

00:32:35.240 --> 00:32:36.330 line:0%
Lord Lai,

00:32:36.400 --> 00:32:38.600 line:0%
could you spare this child

00:32:39.170 --> 00:32:40.760 line:0%
for my sake?

00:32:49.720 --> 00:32:51.450 line:0%
Since Your Highness has asked,

00:32:51.990 --> 00:32:54.000 line:0%
of course I'll release the child.

00:32:56.200 --> 00:32:57.000 line:0%
Release him.

00:32:58.240 --> 00:32:59.200 line:0%
-Thank you, Your Highness.
-Thank you, my lord.

00:32:59.200 --> 00:33:00.160 line:0%
It's good that the child is okay.

00:33:00.160 --> 00:33:01.000 line:0%
Thank you, my lord.

00:33:01.000 --> 00:33:01.720 line:0%
You may go.

00:33:02.430 --> 00:33:05.490 line:0%
-Thank you, Your Highness.
-Thank you, Your Highness.

00:33:05.840 --> 00:33:06.760 line:0%
Princess Ying

00:33:06.760 --> 00:33:08.450 line:0%
truly has a heart of gold.

00:33:08.560 --> 00:33:10.360 line:0%
Princess Ying is truly magnanimous

00:33:10.360 --> 00:33:11.690 line:0%
and full of compassion.

00:33:17.040 --> 00:33:18.500 line:0%
Farewell, Your Highness.

00:33:31.840 --> 00:33:33.040 line:0%
Go back and get 20 strokes!

00:33:33.040 --> 00:33:33.680 line:0%
Yes.

00:33:49.250 --> 00:33:50.840 line:0%
Who is that woman?

00:33:57.770 --> 00:33:59.220 line:0%
[Imperial Security Bureau]

00:34:02.160 --> 00:34:02.960 line:0%
What's wrong?

00:34:03.750 --> 00:34:04.940 line:0%
[Imperial Security Bureau]

00:34:04.320 --> 00:34:05.640 line:0%
Lai Luozhi went to the palace to complain,

00:34:05.640 --> 00:34:07.040 line:0%
saying the Grand Commander isn't handling the case well.

00:34:07.040 --> 00:34:08.030 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager

00:34:08.030 --> 00:34:09.320 line:0%
has taken him away.

00:34:14.160 --> 00:34:15.200 line:0%
You two, guard the entrance.

00:34:15.200 --> 00:34:16.080 line:0%
If there's any news about the Grand Commander,

00:34:16.080 --> 00:34:16.760 line:0%
report it immediately.

00:34:16.760 --> 00:34:17.400 line:0%
Yes.

00:34:18.050 --> 00:34:21.260 line:0%
[Grand Commander's Office]

00:34:18.740 --> 00:34:19.870 line:0%
No one is allowed in.

00:34:23.200 --> 00:34:23.990 line:0%
Grand Commander ordered,

00:34:23.990 --> 00:34:24.470 line:0%
without permission,

00:34:24.470 --> 00:34:25.680 line:0%
no one is to approach the office.

00:34:25.680 --> 00:34:26.740 line:0%
Whoever disobeysâ€¦

00:34:28.640 --> 00:34:29.360 line:0%
If you...

00:34:29.360 --> 00:34:29.840 line:0%
If you want to break in,

00:34:29.840 --> 00:34:31.640 line:0%
you'll have to step over my body.

00:34:42.880 --> 00:34:43.680 line:0%
Stop it.

00:34:43.760 --> 00:34:45.760 line:0%
If you do it again, I won't be so nice.

00:34:47.280 --> 00:34:48.360 line:0%
Stop it!

00:34:49.800 --> 00:34:51.280 line:0%
If you keep doing this, I'll kill myself!

00:34:51.280 --> 00:34:51.840 line:0%
If you don't want to

00:34:51.840 --> 00:34:53.470 line:0%
save the Grand Commander's life,

00:34:53.470 --> 00:34:54.400 line:0%
then go ahead.

00:34:56.510 --> 00:34:57.320 line:0%
Grind the ink.

00:34:59.200 --> 00:35:00.000 line:0%
Grind the ink.

00:35:04.350 --> 00:35:05.480 line:0%
I hope it's not too late

00:35:05.480 --> 00:35:06.680 line:0%
to submit the report.

00:35:12.560 --> 00:35:14.060 line:0%
[General, Yu Shikun][Left Commander of the Shence Army, Zhao Jun]

00:35:22.180 --> 00:35:24.610 line:0%
[Imperial]

00:35:28.420 --> 00:35:30.100 line:0%
[Imperial Security Bureau]

00:35:32.920 --> 00:35:33.680 line:0%
It's actually the same handwriting

00:35:33.680 --> 00:35:35.140 line:0%
as the Grand Commander's.

00:35:44.920 --> 00:35:45.720 line:0%
Are you sure

00:35:45.720 --> 00:35:46.360 line:0%
this can really

00:35:46.360 --> 00:35:47.160 line:0%
save the Grand Commander?

00:35:47.160 --> 00:35:49.120 line:0%
I can't say for certain he'll be fine,

00:35:49.120 --> 00:35:50.440 line:0%
but we have to at least try.

00:35:49.910 --> 00:35:52.130 line:0%
[General, Yu Shikun][Left Commander of the Shence Army, Zhao Jun]

00:35:50.840 --> 00:35:53.570 line:0%
Perhaps it can spare him from severe punishment.

00:36:04.200 --> 00:36:04.960 line:0%
What are you waiting for?

00:36:04.960 --> 00:36:06.000 line:0%
Go quickly!

00:36:06.560 --> 00:36:07.820 line:0%
I'll wait for you here.

00:36:08.760 --> 00:36:10.420 line:0%
Stop rummaging through them.

00:36:14.970 --> 00:36:18.410 line:0%
[Cangming Hall]

00:36:17.800 --> 00:36:18.920 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:36:19.480 --> 00:36:21.080 line:0%
the Imperial Security Bureau has handled the case for days

00:36:21.080 --> 00:36:22.680 line:0%
but hasn't solved it.

00:36:23.000 --> 00:36:24.880 line:0%
Now rumors are spreading that

00:36:25.080 --> 00:36:27.940 line:0%
the court is incompetent in appointing officials.

00:36:28.160 --> 00:36:30.080 line:0%
Some even speculate that the court's

00:36:30.080 --> 00:36:32.040 line:0%
deliberately protecting the Liang family.

00:36:32.040 --> 00:36:34.200 line:0%
This is damaging your reputation.

00:36:35.200 --> 00:36:37.200 line:0%
Your Majesty, I humbly request to let

00:36:37.200 --> 00:36:40.040 line:0%
the Imperial Investigation Department take over.

00:36:40.040 --> 00:36:41.600 line:0%
Lai, what you say

00:36:42.240 --> 00:36:44.640 line:0%
is exactly also my concern.

00:36:47.420 --> 00:36:50.480 line:0%
Shen Du from the Imperial Security Bureau has arrived.

00:37:04.360 --> 00:37:06.020 line:0%
Your Majesty, I, Shen Du, the Grand Commander,

00:37:06.020 --> 00:37:07.440 line:0%
pay my respects to you.

00:37:07.840 --> 00:37:09.960 line:0%
Long live the Grand Empress Dowager.

00:37:10.760 --> 00:37:11.960 line:0%
Mr. Shen,

00:37:12.760 --> 00:37:14.160 line:0%
the Liang family case

00:37:14.620 --> 00:37:16.080 line:0%
remains unsolved.

00:37:16.280 --> 00:37:17.200 line:0%
Don't you think you should

00:37:17.200 --> 00:37:19.140 line:0%
give me an explanation?

00:37:19.170 --> 00:37:20.280 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:37:20.600 --> 00:37:22.560 line:0%
the Liang family murder is not an isolated case.

00:37:22.560 --> 00:37:23.800 line:0%
It is connected to the multiple bodies

00:37:23.800 --> 00:37:25.480 line:0%
that have been found at Ximing Temple.

00:37:25.480 --> 00:37:26.920 line:0%
They were all committed by the same killer.

00:37:26.920 --> 00:37:28.440 line:0%
The Imperial Security Bureau is already working on

00:37:28.440 --> 00:37:29.890 line:0%
combining the cases based on the evidence.

00:37:29.890 --> 00:37:33.040 line:0%
The Liang family case involves high-ranking officials.

00:37:33.040 --> 00:37:34.000 line:0%
Moreover, Ximing Temple is

00:37:34.000 --> 00:37:36.080 line:0%
a place for quiet worship and meditation.

00:37:36.080 --> 00:37:37.760 line:0%
Now, with these unsolved cases,

00:37:37.760 --> 00:37:40.040 line:0%
a disturbing nursery rhyme has spread in the city.

00:37:40.040 --> 00:37:41.840 line:0%
Its content is quite offensive.

00:37:44.600 --> 00:37:45.840 line:0%
Let's hear it.

00:37:46.960 --> 00:37:48.210 line:0%
Please allow me

00:37:48.400 --> 00:37:49.880 line:0%
to recite this nursery rhyme

00:37:49.880 --> 00:37:51.600 line:0%
for Your Majesty.

00:37:54.170 --> 00:37:55.430 line:0%
People are heartless.

00:37:55.900 --> 00:37:57.270 line:0%
Buddha eats hearts.

00:37:58.010 --> 00:38:00.470 line:0%
Chaos reigns under the Son of Heaven's feet.

00:38:00.720 --> 00:38:03.520 line:0%
Buddha devours hearts to conceal sins.

00:38:04.200 --> 00:38:05.000 line:0%
How dare you!

00:38:05.640 --> 00:38:07.080 line:0%
Please calm down, Your Majesty.

00:38:07.080 --> 00:38:07.880 line:0%
I believe

00:38:07.880 --> 00:38:09.280 line:0%
this nursery rhyme has spread

00:38:09.280 --> 00:38:10.440 line:0%
because the Ximing Temple case

00:38:10.440 --> 00:38:11.640 line:0%
remains unresolved.

00:38:11.760 --> 00:38:14.080 line:0%
If the Imperial Security Bureau still can't find the real culprit,

00:38:14.080 --> 00:38:15.200 line:0%
perhaps holding

00:38:15.200 --> 00:38:16.400 line:0%
an exorcism would be

00:38:16.400 --> 00:38:17.330 line:0%
more effective.

00:38:17.760 --> 00:38:19.400 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager's dignity is unmatched.

00:38:19.400 --> 00:38:20.240 line:0%
There's no need to concern

00:38:20.240 --> 00:38:22.170 line:0%
with these absurd superstitions.

00:38:30.560 --> 00:38:31.820 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen,

00:38:32.200 --> 00:38:33.330 line:0%
did you forget this?

00:38:46.160 --> 00:38:48.290 line:0%
The guards suddenly came to arrest me.

00:38:48.480 --> 00:38:50.200 line:0%
I was just organizing the case details

00:38:50.200 --> 00:38:52.260 line:0%
to present them to you, Your Majesty.

00:39:07.000 --> 00:39:10.060 line:0%
"In a peaceful world, only the Buddha's heart remains.

00:39:10.200 --> 00:39:12.930 line:0%
All evil thoughts vanish, never to return again.

00:39:13.680 --> 00:39:16.340 line:0%
Unraveling the truth, washing away the unjust.

00:39:17.120 --> 00:39:20.050 line:0%
With keen insight, the world finds peace and trust."

00:39:21.640 --> 00:39:22.440 line:0%
Very good.

00:39:22.840 --> 00:39:23.940 line:0%
Well, since

00:39:24.760 --> 00:39:25.920 line:0%
you've already uncovered

00:39:25.920 --> 00:39:27.560 line:0%
many clues about the Liang family

00:39:27.560 --> 00:39:29.120 line:0%
and Ximing Temple,

00:39:29.200 --> 00:39:31.330 line:0%
then proceed with the investigation.

00:39:32.400 --> 00:39:34.480 line:0%
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:39:37.360 --> 00:39:38.640 line:0%
Mr. Shen,

00:39:39.080 --> 00:39:41.340 line:0%
you also mentioned in your report

00:39:41.880 --> 00:39:44.840 line:0%
that there's more to the self-immolation at Ming Hall.

00:39:44.840 --> 00:39:45.600 line:0%
The immolator

00:39:45.600 --> 00:39:48.340 line:0%
was not expressing dissatisfaction,

00:39:49.040 --> 00:39:52.360 line:0%
but rather using death to convey a message to me,

00:39:52.360 --> 00:39:53.760 line:0%
as a last resort.

00:39:55.220 --> 00:39:56.280 line:0%
Is that true?

00:39:56.520 --> 00:39:58.040 line:0%
I'm currently double-checking

00:39:58.040 --> 00:39:59.500 line:0%
and will report back soon.

00:40:00.960 --> 00:40:02.020 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:40:02.520 --> 00:40:03.640 line:0%
Alright, alright.

00:40:04.240 --> 00:40:05.520 line:0%
You two

00:40:05.560 --> 00:40:07.800 line:0%
are like my right and left arms,

00:40:08.160 --> 00:40:09.820 line:0%
each with your own strengths.

00:40:11.920 --> 00:40:12.720 line:0%
Alright.

00:40:12.840 --> 00:40:15.550 line:0%
Let's call it a day.

00:40:15.960 --> 00:40:17.160 line:0%
You may all leave now.

00:40:25.560 --> 00:40:26.680 line:0%
Mr. Shen,

00:40:29.200 --> 00:40:30.200 line:0%
please stay.

00:40:31.400 --> 00:40:34.360 line:0%
I have another task for you

00:40:35.040 --> 00:40:38.640 line:0%
to handle immediately.

00:40:49.320 --> 00:40:51.040 line:0%
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:40:58.930 --> 00:41:00.190 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen,

00:41:05.720 --> 00:41:08.040 line:0%
today in front of the Grand Empress Dowager,

00:41:08.040 --> 00:41:09.800 line:0%
you remained composed,

00:41:09.830 --> 00:41:11.200 line:0%
with a silver tongue.

00:41:11.240 --> 00:41:12.920 line:0%
It's truly admirable.

00:41:12.920 --> 00:41:14.320 line:0%
Lord Lai, I'm flattered.

00:41:14.720 --> 00:41:16.560 line:0%
I was merely stating the facts.

00:41:21.560 --> 00:41:22.790 line:0%
People say

00:41:23.440 --> 00:41:24.480 line:0%
the Imperial Security Bureau

00:41:24.480 --> 00:41:26.800 line:0%
is the Grand Empress Dowager's eyes.

00:41:27.320 --> 00:41:29.450 line:0%
But if those eyes keep darting around,

00:41:29.640 --> 00:41:31.700 line:0%
they might focus on the wrong things.

00:41:31.800 --> 00:41:33.460 line:0%
The actions of the Imperial Security Bureau

00:41:33.460 --> 00:41:34.920 line:0%
are all within our duties.

00:41:35.120 --> 00:41:36.640 line:0%
Unlike the Imperial Investigation Department,

00:41:36.640 --> 00:41:38.680 line:0%
with its fangs tearing at everything in sight.

00:41:38.680 --> 00:41:40.120 line:0%
If it were someone else,

00:41:40.160 --> 00:41:41.920 line:0%
they might be overwhelmed.

00:41:46.560 --> 00:41:47.280 line:0%
Then I hope

00:41:47.280 --> 00:41:49.160 line:0%
you solve the case soon.

00:41:52.920 --> 00:41:54.720 line:0%
Afterall, there are many people

00:41:56.320 --> 00:41:57.720 line:0%
sharpening their teeth now.